\ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
\ src/chacha.fam — ChaCha20 and Poly1305, and the two as one AEAD (RFC 8439):
\ the symmetric encryption of the payment network's sessions.
\
\   chacha ( key nonce ctr src dst n -- )   n bytes encrypted (or decrypted:
\                               the same) with a 32-byte key and 12-byte
\                               nonce, the block counter starting at ctr
\   p1beg ( key -- )  p1abs ( a n -- )  p1end ( out -- )   Poly1305: a
\                               one-time 32-byte key, the message (in any
\                               pieces), the 16-byte tag
\   aeseal ( key nonce aad an pt n ct -- )   the AEAD: n bytes encrypted to
\                               ct, then the 16-byte tag over them and the aad
\   aeopen ( key nonce aad an ct n pt -- ok )   whether ct's tag (at ct + n)
\                               checks; if so, the n bytes decrypted to pt
\ ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

